    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
      "author": "Keegan Matheson",
      "team": "ブルージェイズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Back on #BlueJays this week. I expect we'll hear more on Anthony Santander tomorrow, when Ross Atkins speaks with reporters at the GM Meetings in Las Vegas. Hearing directly from Santander, who shared Islamophobic posts on his Instagram, should also be a necessary part of this.",
      "likes": 58,
      "reposts": 2,
      "replies": 9,
      "at": "2026-11-09T13:38:11.819Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzv2dfhzic2i",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "I don’t think there’s any reason we need to hear from Santander directly, his posts were consistent, extreme and wildly out of character for anyone who should wear the jersey. I know plenty of players are conservative, but that’s different than public hate speech. He should be DFA’ed ASAP.",
          "likes": 10,
          "author": "buddytheelf.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "I've heard enough from Santander. I'm disappointed in the weak response from the blue jays organization.",
          "likes": 6,
          "author": "grilledcheese.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Any comments Santander makes would be meaningless. I don’t  want to hear a fake, forced apology. He won’t be contrite, he’ll just be doing what’s he told.  \n\nAlso: very disappointed in Sportsnet for their lack of coverage on this. Cowardly.",
          "likes": 6,
          "author": "seaflower-1.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "I dont think i need to hear anything from that guy.",
          "likes": 6,
          "author": "ckimberley.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "今週は#BlueJaysの取材に戻ります。明日、ラスベガスのGMミーティングでロス・アトキンスGMが報道陣に話す際、アンソニー・サンタンデールについても新たな話が聞けそうです。イスラム嫌悪的な投稿をInstagramでシェアしたサンタンデール本人の説明も、必要な要素になるはずです。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
      "author": "Keegan Matheson",
      "team": "ブルージェイズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Is Ernie Clement the #BlueJays' starting 2B in 2027? Perhaps that's too narrow a question. Story on their search for offensive upgrades, including a look at Jazz Chisholm Jr.'s potential fit: www.mlb.com/bluejays/new...",
      "likes": 20,
      "reposts": 0,
      "replies": 3,
      "at": "2026-11-09T17:29:53.281Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzvhbowvzc2j",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "Please, no Jazz. He still has the taint of the Yankees on him.",
          "likes": 4,
          "author": "pay-vladdy.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Has Santander been released yet",
          "likes": 1,
          "author": "greyareaperson.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Barger to 2nd to protect the arm, Ernie to super utility, rotate Barger, Kirk, Valenzuela, Okamoto, and Guerrero through DH, rest Giménez or Barger against lefties by playing Ernie, and blow all that money in the outfield corners.",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "jwhite.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "アーニー・クレメントは2027年の#BlueJaysの開幕2塁手になるのか？問いとしては狭すぎるかもしれません。攻撃面の補強を探る動きと、ジャズ・チソムJr.が合う可能性についての記事です。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "afkostka.bsky.social",
      "author": "Andy Kostka",
      "team": "オリオールズ",
      "outlet": "Baltimore Banner",
      "text": "Five matches done. My Atmosphere/Experience rankings for West Ham, Birmingham, Brighton, Bristol City and Portsmouth",
      "likes": 13,
      "reposts": 1,
      "replies": 2,
      "at": "2026-11-08T16:52:56.688Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:licyksm72ljqiq4oxbwxu2mi/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzsuqpldas2t",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "1. Fratton Park, Portsmouth: By and far the best experience. An antique ground with the loveliest supporters in every section. The safe standing sections were great",
          "likes": 8,
          "author": "afkostka.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Enjoying your coverage of your tour",
          "likes": 2,
          "author": "tomedsall.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "5試合を観戦し終えました。ウェストハム、バーミンガム、ブライトン、ブリストル・シティ、ポーツマスの雰囲気・体験ランキングです。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "timstebbins.bsky.social",
      "author": "Tim Stebbins",
      "team": "ガーディアンズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "The Guardians signed lefty Antoine Kelly to a Minor League deal with an invite to Spring Training.",
      "likes": 15,
      "reposts": 0,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-09T14:55:07.809Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:jrwmzzblbtbegomwff262gv4/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzv6mxmsbc2a",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ガーディアンズが左腕アントワーヌ・ケリーとマイナー契約を結びました。春季キャンプ招待付きです。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "afkostka.bsky.social",
      "author": "Andy Kostka",
      "team": "オリオールズ",
      "outlet": "Baltimore Banner",
      "text": "5. London Stadium, West Ham: it is with a heavy heart to say my dear West Ham are pathetic. As we sing, “We sold our soul for this shit hole.” I’ve been to Upton Park matches. Now that was an atmosphere. We are too spread out here and the dismal play means there little about which to be excited",
      "likes": 10,
      "reposts": 1,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-08T16:52:56.693Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:licyksm72ljqiq4oxbwxu2mi/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzsurkcy4c2t",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "5位 ロンドン・スタジアム（ウェストハム）：残念ですが、愛するウェストハムは情けない状態です。「このひどい本拠地のために魂を売った」と歌うほどです。アプトン・パークの試合も知っていますが、あれこそ本物の雰囲気でした。ここは観客席が散らばりすぎ、試合内容も悲惨で、盛り上がれる要素がほとんどありません。"
    },
    {
